Subject: [Powertop] [PATCH] Support ncurses when built with tinfo
Date: Thu, 14 Jun 2018 13:34:07 -0700
Message-ID: <CAOOEN5KMgdgbqGd4vN0RXOw2Zmtmcku731rwvREC5Zcrc6i=Gg@mail.gmail.com>
